UnitVoterPaymentsModule::setFee
├── when the caller does not hold the fee manager role
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller holds the fee manager role
    ├── when the rate exceeds PIPS
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidFeeRate
    └── when the rate is within bounds
        ├── when the entry is already registered at the same rate
        │   ├── it should not emit FeeSet
        │   └── it should leave the fee record unchanged
        ├── when the entry is already registered at a different rate
        │   ├── it should store the new rate
        │   └── it should emit FeeSet
        ├── when caller is the default sentinel address zero
        │   ├── it should store the rate with registered true
        │   └── it should emit FeeSet
        └── when caller is a concrete address
            ├── it should store the rate with registered true
            └── it should emit FeeSet
